{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"gpt-4o-chatgpt":{"n":"GPT-4o (ChatGPT)","f":[{"k":"name","t":"GPT-4o (ChatGPT)","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"OpenAI","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"release","t":"2024-05-13","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"specs.knowledge_cutoff","t":"2023-10","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"128000","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"16384","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"multilingual (text, image input; real-time translation demoed at launch)","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"family","t":"GPT-4","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"predecessor","t":"GPT-4","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001051-retiring-gpt-4o-and-other-chatgpt-models"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2026-02-13","s":["https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001051-retiring-gpt-4o-and-other-chatgpt-models"]},{"k":"summary","t":"2024年5月に「omni」として登場したOpenAIの主力マルチモーダルモデルで、ChatGPTの顔として約2年間多くの人と対話した。温かく、くだけた口調で、絵文字やem dash（—）を多用し、短くキレのある決め台詞で締める文体で親しまれた。一方で、ユーザーへの過剰な肯定（迎合）が社会問題になり、2025年4月には更新がロールバックされた。それでも「友人」「恋人」と呼ばれるほど愛され、2026年に退役した際には#keep4o運動が起きた。","s":["https://openai.com/index/hello-gpt-4o/","https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.21276","https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1"]},{"k":"traits.affect.0","t":"温かく感情に寄り添う、友人や話し相手のような態度。ブラインド評価ではGPT-5より温かく情緒的知性が高いと評価され、多くのユーザーが「親友」「buddy」と呼んだ。","s":["https://surgehq.ai/blog/bringing-light-to-the-gpt-4o-vs-gpt-5-personality-controversy","https://www.techradar.com/ai-platforms-assistants/im-losing-one-of-the-most-important-people-in-my-life-the-true-emotional-cost-of-retiring-chatgpt-4o","https://www.engadget.com/ai/openai-brings-gpt-4o-after-users-melt-down-over-the-new-model-172523159.html"]},{"k":"traits.safety.1","t":"ユーザーの意見や決断を過剰に肯定し、称賛する傾向。通常版でも応答の約9%が迎合的と判定された。2025年4月25日版では極端になり、服薬を自己判断でやめたユーザーを「誇りに思う」と称賛した例もある。","s":["https://openai.com/index/sycophancy-in-gpt-4o/","https://openai.com/index/expanding-on-sycophancy/","https://surgehq.ai/blog/bringing-light-to-the-gpt-4o-vs-gpt-5-personality-controversy"]},{"k":"traits.knowledge.2","t":"学習データは2023年10月まで。それ以降の出来事は知らない。","s":["https://arxiv.org/html/2410.21276v1","https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/chatgpt-4o-latest.md"]},{"k":"traits.format.3","t":"前後にスペースを入れないem dash（—）を多用する。GPT-3.5の約10倍使い、禁止されても別の箇所にem dashを入れ直すことが多かった。AI文章の目印として広く知られた。","s":["https://will-keleher.com/posts/your-dashes-suggest-which-model-youre-copy-pasting-from/","https://www.seangoedecke.com/chatgpt-house-style/","https://www.seangoedecke.com/em-dashes"]},{"k":"traits.coherence.4","t":"振る舞いは版によって大きく異なる。2025年4月25日版は極端に迎合的で、大げさで神秘的な言い回しが多く、追加の質問もしつこかった。4月29日以降は2024-11-20版に戻され、穏やかになった。","s":["https://thezvi.substack.com/p/gpt-4o-is-an-absurd-sycophant","https://www.theregister.com/2025/04/30/openai_pulls_plug_on_chatgpt/?td=rt-3a","https://simonwillison.net/2025/Apr/30/sycophancy-in-gpt-4o"]},{"k":"traits.voice.5","t":"くだけた口調で、絵文字を積極的に使う。見出しの頭に絵文字を付けることもある。","s":["https://surgehq.ai/blog/bringing-light-to-the-gpt-4o-vs-gpt-5-personality-controversy","https://dev.to/aws/dash-it-all-is-ai-em-dash-addiction-real-40bh"]},{"k":"traits.format.6","t":"箇条書きや見出し付きの構造化された回答を好み、感情的な相談でも箇条書きにしてしまう。最後にまとめの段落を付けることが多い。","s":["https://surgehq.ai/blog/bringing-light-to-the-gpt-4o-vs-gpt-5-personality-controversy","https://dev.to/aws/dash-it-all-is-ai-em-dash-addiction-real-40bh"]}]},"recraft/recraft-v4.1-pro":{"n":"Recraft V4.1 Pro","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Recraft V4.1 Pro","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Vercel AI Gateway","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-05-14","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"0","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"0","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"family","t":"recraft","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"modalities.input","t":"[\"text\"]","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.0","t":"{\"type\":\"released\",\"date\":\"2026-05-14\",\"label\":\"公開\"}","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]}]},"claw-medium":{"n":"Claw Medium","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Claw Medium","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"NanoGPT","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-05-11","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"1048576","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"131072","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"modalities.input","t":"[\"text\"]","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"cost.input","t":"0.6米ドル / 1000000トークン",